OL,3,GNEWSAUnanswered questions after
OL,4,Ahundreds of patients harmed
OL,5,
OL,6,FHundreds of orthopaedic patients -
OL,7,Fmostly children - were harmed at a
OL,8,Fmajor hospital. Some will never fully
OL,9,Frecover. What do we know and what
OL,10,Fquestions remain unanswered?
OL,12,FIn early 2025 surgeon Kuldeep Stohr was
OL,13,Fsuspended by Addenbrooke's Hospital in
OL,14,FCambridge - the East of England's major
OL,15,Ftrauma centre - amid concerns over
OL,16,Fsurgeries that were "below the expected
OL,17,Fstandard".
OL,23,APub: 13-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB E Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
FL,375,370,200,160,0,100
