OL,3,GNEWSAUnanswered questions after
OL,4,Ahundreds of patients harmed
OL,5,
OL,6,FTwo separate reviews began and it was
OL,7,Fan update on one of those that was
OL,8,Fmistakenly released then removed from
OL,9,Fthe hospital trust's board papers that
OL,10,Frevealed the true scale of the damage.
OL,12,FIt stated of the 924 patients reviewed
OL,13,Fso far, 209 "experienced harm", the
OL,14,Fmajority of whom were children when
OL,15,Fthey had elective surgery. Forty-seven
OL,16,Fwere classed as severe, with one being
OL,17,Ffatal.
